            These are the chords of the song Tonight by Dotan.
I based this tab on just listening to the song so if you have any improvements, feel free to leave a comment! :)

He plays a chord in the verses after the C which is called Dadd9/add4 Well, actually I searched for the
shape and found this is the name of the chord. It's actually a C-chord that is moved up 2 frets and sounds
a little bit like a fancy D-chord. It looks like this:

e--0--
[D--3--]
[Bb--0--]
[F--4--]
[C--5--]
[G-----]

For the strumming/picking pattern, I recommend listening to the song. It's relatively easy to figure out :)

